{{!
    @template local_oksigeniaayvurenda/listen

    «Listen» beside a text a young reader may not read yet: it plays its voice (one clip or several, in turn), and a
    second touch stops it.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * urls - the voice clips, separated by spaces
    * label - what the button says

    Example context (json):
    {
        "urls": "https://example.org/voz/ui/es/homequestion.mp3",
        "label": "Escuchar"
    }
}}
<button type="button" class="ayv-listen" data-ayv-say="{{urls}}" aria-pressed="false">{{> local_oksigeniaayvurenda/icon_volume}} <span>{{label}}</span></button>
